@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] deterministic-racing-draws
Valid draws MUST be stateless, depend only on seed/tag/range, and retain the reference
UTF-16 hash and JSON-string key semantics. Draws MUST use rejection sampling rather than
biased modulo alone (except HRVisual::Draw, which retains the reference mobile visual-genome
modulo reduction and fails explicitly on Max < 1). Checked APIs MUST reject nonpositive or oversized bounds, negative
weights and overflowing/zero weight sums without changing the output. Internal checked
convenience calls MUST fail explicitly on invalid arguments in every build, never hang
or produce a fallback draw. Untrusted values MUST use the nonfatal checked APIs.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:architecture] racing-rules-boundary
Yorimichi MUST own the racing plugin, its rules and build inputs under its game directory.
Rules MUST remain independent of actors, UI and rendering assets; presentation, authored venue
data, runtime authority and persistence admission remain separate game-owned concerns.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] racing-clock-boundaries
The calendar MUST retain the reference two-hour days, twelve-day seasons, horse-age
clock and Grand Prix dates. Schedule phases MUST use half-open boundaries and select
the last slot whose computed start is not later than the query. External schedule
admission MUST reject nonfinite/out-of-range times and negative counts without changing
output. Searching a schedule MUST NOT perform work proportional to an untrusted count.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] racing-value-arithmetic
Horse value structures MUST NOT be treated as admitted external state. Their arithmetic
helpers MUST widen before addition so malformed int32 values cannot cause signed overflow.
Gene-pair indexing MUST reject indices outside 0/1 rather than silently choosing an allele.
Public reflected data structures MUST be exported for consumers in other modules.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] racing-breed-inheritance
Breed expression and inheritance MUST retain the four-allele dominance table and
semantic founder/inheritance draw tags. Checked APIs MUST reject either malformed
parent allele or output alias to any parent gene before changing their output.
Missing genes MUST retain the reference Standard phenotype or per-side founder draw,
and parents MUST remain unchanged.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] racing-save-and-economy-invariants
HRSave::FromJson and HRSave::Validate MUST verify schema/rules versions, required fields,
duplicate JSON keys, collection bounds, unique IDs, cross-references and numeric/allele
ranges before mutating the output world state. Coin balances MUST saturate in 0..MaxCoins
with int64 pool sums, SettleRace MUST skip declared races and settle refunds before
winner payouts so odds are order-independent, and AdvanceTo catch-up MUST ignore nonfinite
times and bound catch-up to at most MaxCatchUpDays per call.
Replicated client snapshots MUST NOT expose FHRWorldState::Seed or a derivation of it.
